/*
 * The Database setup guide in Dutch (#8341): each piece of the English
 * guide's markdown (Pages/Database/Utils/DocumentationMarkdown.ts) and its
 * Dutch. Code, field names and product names are as the English writes
 * them, and what the Dashboard draws is named as its Dutch words it.
 * Change it with the English, in the same pull request
 * (SetupGuideDocumentationInLocale).
 */
